ting the \"Import Audio\" button to import audio\n\n\u25c7 Tap the action button and selecting the \"Import Audio\" button to import audio\n\n* Supported all audio format\n\n* Supported all audio format\n\n\u25c7 Set your preferred language before recording:\n\n\u25c7 Set your preferred language before recording:\n\n* Go to \u201cProfile\u201d go to \u201cNote Setting\u201d go to \u201cLanguage\u201d and select your preferred language.\n\n* Go to \u201cProfile\u201d go to \u201cNote Setting\u201d go to \u201cLanguage\u201d and select your preferred language.\n\n* Select main language for best transcription\n\n* Select main language for best transcription\n\n\u25c7 After recording or uploading content, instantly transform it into:\n\n\u25c7 After recording or uploading content, instantly transform it into:\n\n* AI Summary\n\n* AI Summary\n\n* AI Note\n\n* AI Note\n\n* Quiz\n\n* Quiz\n\n* Flashcard\n\n* Flashcard\n\n* Full content\n\n* Full content\n\n### \ud83d\uddc2\ufe0f Organization\n\n### \ud83d\uddc2\ufe0f Organization\n\n\u25c7 Use the top tabs to switch between:\n\n\u25c7 Use the top tabs to switch between:\n\n* Note\n\n* Note\n\n* Folder\n\n* Folder\n\n* Prompt\n\n* Prompt\n\n### Modes\n\n### Modes\n\nBy going to \u201cProfile\u201d to \u201cUser Mode\u201d you can select your preferred mode\n\nBy going to \u201cProfile\u201d to \u201cUser Mode\u201d you can select your preferred mode\n\nEach mode offers different tailored AI functions (coming soon)\n\nEach mode offers different tailored AI functions (coming soon)\n\n### \ud83d\udca1 Quick Tips\n\n### \ud83d\udca1 Quick Tips\n\n\u25c7 Tap the three dots (\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7) above each note to access more functions: Timestamp, Translate, Export and Delete\n\n\u25c7 Tap the three dots (\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7) above each note to access more functions: Timestamp, Translate, Export and Delete\n\n\u25c7 Use folders to keep related content together\n\n\u25c7 Use folders to keep related content together\n\nPrompt is used